---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Essential Chinese Phrases for Travelers";
const description = "Learn these basic Chinese phrases before your trip — pronunciation, when to use them, and tips for being understood.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Life
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🗣️ Life in China</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Essential Chinese Phrases for Travelers
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">A dozen phrases will change how people treat you.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 Last updated: June 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 4 min read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 Quick Answer</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        You don't need to speak Chinese to travel in China. But learning a dozen phrases will make your trip immensely better — locals genuinely appreciate the effort, and you'll find yourself getting better service, warmer smiles, and even better prices at markets.
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 In This Guide</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#greetings" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">👋 Greetings & Politeness</a></li>
        <li><a href="#eating" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍽️ Eating & Ordering</a></li>
        <li><a href="#shopping" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛍️ Shopping & Prices</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 Getting Around</a></li>
        <li><a href="#emergencies" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🆘 Emergencies</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pronunciation" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎵 Pronunciation Tips</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="greetings" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">👋</span> Greetings & Politeness
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">English</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Pinyin</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Hello</td><td class="px-6 py-4">你好</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Nǐ hǎo</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Use with anyone, any time</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Thank you</td><td class="px-6 py-4">谢谢</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Xiè xiè</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Say it often — people notice</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Sorry / Excuse me</td><td class="px-6 py-4">对不起</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duì bù qǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">If you bump into someone</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">It's okay</td><td class="px-6 py-4">没关系</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Méi guān xì</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Response to "sorry"</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Goodbye</td><td class="px-6 py-4">再见</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Zài jiàn</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Standard farewell</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>Tip:</strong> Say "Thank you" after every transaction — at restaurants, shops, taxis. It goes a long way in daily interactions.</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="eating" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍽️</span> Eating & Ordering
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">English</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Pinyin</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Check, please</td><td class="px-6 py-4">买单</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Mǎi dān</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wave your hand slightly</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Delicious!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">好吃！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Hǎo chī!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Compliment the chef</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">No spicy</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不加辣</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Bù jiā là</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Essential in Sichuan/Hunan</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Water, please</td><td class="px-6 py-4">请给我水</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Qǐng gěi wǒ shuǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Don't drink tap water</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="shopping" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛍️</span> Shopping & Prices
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">English</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Pinyin</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">How much?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多少钱？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duō shǎo qián?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Universal price question</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Too expensive</td><td class="px-6 py-4">太贵了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Tài guì le</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Only at markets</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Can you lower it?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">便宜一点？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Pián yí yì diǎn?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Use at markets, not stores</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'll take it</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我要这个</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ yào zhè ge</td><td class="px-6 py-4">When you've decided</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🚇</span> Getting Around
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">English</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Pinyin</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Where is...?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...在哪里？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...zài nǎ lǐ?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Show place name in Chinese</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'm going here</td><td class="px-6 py-4">去这里</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Qù zhè lǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Show address to driver</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Stop here</td><td class="px-6 py-4">这里停</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Zhè lǐ tíng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">For taxis</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">How long?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多久？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duō jiǔ?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Travel or wait time</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>Pro tip:</strong> Always show your destination in Chinese characters.</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="emergencies" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🆘</span> Emergencies
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">English</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Pinyin</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Help!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">救命！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Jiù mìng!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Only for real emergencies</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Call the police</td><td class="px-6 py-4">报警</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Bào jǐng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Emergency number: 110</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">I need a doctor</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要医生</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ xū yào yī shēng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Emergency number: 120</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'm lost</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我迷路了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ mí lù le</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Show destination in Chinese</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="pronunciation" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎵</span> Pronunciation Tips
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">Chinese uses <strong>tones</strong> — the same syllable said in different pitches means different things. But don't stress too much. Context usually makes your meaning clear, and locals are forgiving of tourists.</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">The four tones:</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Tone</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Example</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Meaning</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Description</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">1st</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mā (妈)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mom</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Flat, high pitch</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">2nd</td><td class="px-6 py-4">má (麻)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">benumb</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Rising pitch</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">3rd</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mǎ (马)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">horse</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Fall then rise</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">4th</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mà (骂)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">scold</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Sharp drop</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>Best tip:</strong> Speak slowly and clearly. Most Chinese people are used to foreigners struggling with tones and will try to understand.</p>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 Related Guides</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 Your China Trip Survival Kit</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">The complete pre-travel checklist</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 10 Apps You Need for China</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Essential apps including translation tools</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/tips/cultural-taboos/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🏮 Cultural Dos and Don'ts</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Navigate social situations with confidence</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Sources</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>Language reference — no single official source.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>